                    1, "MRO utilizes the C3 linearization algorithm to define a deterministic, predictable order for method resolution in multiple inheritance. Thinking the order is random or strictly depth-first leads to infinite loops or incorrect method calls. Understanding MRO is required for building robust, complex class hierarchies.",
