                    0, "Actors isolate their mutable state, ensuring sequential access across concurrent tasks, inherently preventing data races. Confusing them with UI components ignores Swift 5.5's massive concurrency overhaul. Actors are the modern, safe replacement for manual locks and mutexes.",
                    skillId: 10),
