                    0, "Property Wrappers encapsulate repetitive getters/setters (like UserDefaults fetching or SwiftUI state management) behind a clean `@` syntax. Mistaking them for JSON decoders limits their scope. They drastically reduce boilerplate code across complex architectures.",
